OL,3,AMcCartney and Starr back new Beatles
OL,4,Aattraction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attraction will feature immersive
OL,7,Ftechnology, original artefacts and
OL,8,Frecreated sets charting the band's rise
OL,9,Ffrom post-war Liverpool to
OL,10,Finternational fame.
